## Wildcard made useless by or-patterns

```catala
declaration enumeration E:
  -- A
  -- B
  -- F

declaration scope S:
  context e content E
  output o content integer

scope S:
  definition e equals A
  definition o equals match e with pattern
    -- A or B: 1
    -- F: 2
    -- anything: 3
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope S
┌─[WARNING]─
│
│  Unreachable match case, all constructors of the enumeration E are already
│  specified.
│
├─➤ tests/enum/bad/or_pattern_useless_wildcard.catala_en:18.5-19:
│    │
│ 18 │     -- anything: 3
│    │     ‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾
└─ Wildcard made useless by or-patterns
┌─[RESULT]─ S ─
│ o = 1
└─
```
